# 1. Locked Research Rule

This BMC Helix investigation follows the ART opportunity-mining rule:

> **One company can produce multiple independent opportunities.**

We are therefore not attempting to find one "BMC customer problem."

We are mining BMC Helix for:

1. multiple automation opportunities;
2. multiple AI-agent opportunities;
3. multiple decision opportunities;
4. multiple exception workflows;
5. multiple human-in-the-loop opportunities;
6. multiple cross-system orchestration opportunities;
7. reusable enterprise implementation intelligence.

Every opportunity must remain independently testable.

At the same time, every useful implementation strategy discovered during the research must be captured in `.md` research records so that ART can reuse the pattern for other companies.

